category: Libs
requires: libglib2.0-devel libtss2-mu-devel libtss2-sys-devel libtss2-tcti-tabrmd0 pkg-config
sdesc: "TPM2 Access Broker & Resource Management Daemon implementing the TCG spec (development)"
ldesc: "This is a system daemon implementing the TPM2 access broker (TAB) & Resource
Manager (RM) spec from the TCG. The daemon (tpm2-abrmd) is implemented using
Glib and the GObject system. In this documentation and in the code we use
tpm2-abrmd and tabrmd interchangeably."
external-source: tpm2-abrmd

